        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Jw2-C3n6NH6MLMiiRFBf-104" value="&lt;div&gt;VPC e Cluster EKS&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;- Gerenciamento: Vultr gerencia o control plane e os nós do cluster.&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Cobrança: gratuito o gerenciamento do control plane e cobrado apenas os worker nodes.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Ingress: Não entrega pré-configuração, porém funciona com controladores de entrada, e com integração com o Vultr Load Balancer (testr sem LB - custo)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Rede: Não suporta Vultr VPC2. Suporta Vultr VPC (antigo). Por padrão instala uma rede VPC para os woker nodes. Considerar a opção de instalar outros recursos nessa VPC padrão para comunicação entre os nós do cluster e outras instâncias do lab (banco) ou criar uma nova VPC e relacionar&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Armazenamento: Os dados do cluster (etcd) são criptografados, com backups regulares&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Segurança:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(102, 102, 0), rgb(162, 162, 74)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Firewall&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#666600;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="355" y="411" width="119" height="490" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Jw2-C3n6NH6MLMiiRFBf-119" value="-&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(102, 102, 0), rgb(162, 162, 74));&quot;&gt;MySQL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(102, 102, 0), rgb(162, 162, 74));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(102, 102, 0), rgb(162, 162, 74));&quot;&gt;Region: Altanta&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(102, 102, 0), rgb(162, 162, 74));&quot;&gt;Version: 8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(102, 102, 0), rgb(162, 162, 74));&quot;&gt;Server Type: Cloud Compute&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(102, 102, 0), rgb(162, 162, 74));&quot;&gt;Plan - 1VCPU, 55GB, 2GB DDR4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;NumberForReplicas: 0&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;VPC&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#666600;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1240" y="320" width="120" height="139.04" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Jw2-C3n6NH6MLMiiRFBf-123" style="rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=none;startFill=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;" parent="1" source="Jw2-C3n6NH6MLMiiRFBf-124" target="Jw2-C3n6NH6MLMiiRFBf-94" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1102" y="690.04" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Jw2-C3n6NH6MLMiiRFBf-124" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Requisitos do plano:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;node_quantity - O número de nós neste pool de nós. Utilizar dois nodepool&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;plan - O plano mínimo deve ser de US$ 10 (deve ter pelo menos 1 núcleo e 2 GB de memória)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;region - atl (Atlanta)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;label - Rótulo para cada pool de nós.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="shape=note;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;size=20;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#666600;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" parent="1" vertex="1">
